        "name": "Astro's Playroom",
        "summary": "Astro and his crew lead you on a magical introduction through PS5 in this fun platformer that comes pre-loaded on PS5. Explore four worlds, each based on PS5’s console components. Each area showcases innovative gameplay that taps into the new features of the PS5's DualSense wireless controller.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co9hb4.jpg",
